! PyFerret custom palette for difference plots with configurable white zone
! Blue for negative differences, white near zero, red for positive differences
! This palette is designed for percentage differences with white zone control
!
! Format: percent red green blue
! percent: 0-100 (position in color scale)
! red, green, blue: 0-100 (RGB values)
!
! Blue gradient for large negative differences
  0   0  0 100   ! Dark blue at most negative
 10  20 20 100   ! Medium blue
 20  40 60 100   ! Light blue
 30  60 80 100   ! Very light blue
 40  80 90 100   ! Pale blue
!
! Transition to white for small negative differences
 45  90 95 100   ! Near white
 48  95 98 100   ! Almost white
!
! White zone (narrow band around zero)
 49  98 98  98   ! White
 50 100 100 100   ! Pure white at zero
 51  98  98  98   ! White
!
! Transition to red for small positive differences
 52 100  98  95   ! Almost white
 55 100  95  90   ! Near white
!
! Red gradient for large positive differences
 60 100  80  60   ! Pale red
 70 100  60  40   ! Very light red
 80 100  60  20   ! Light red
 90 100  20  20   ! Medium red
100 100   0   0   ! Dark red at most positive

